# Line endings are LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Two things depend on it. The v0.3 freeze manifest hashes LF content, so a CRLF checkout
# would make the freeze checkable only on the machine that created it. And `codegen:check`
# compares the committed generated types byte for byte against a fresh generation, which a
# checkout that rewrote line endings would fail for no reason anyone could act on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
